  fluid/ - generic VulkanEngine-backed fluid library
  archive/legacy-fluid-blood-v5-20261104 - pre-rebuild implementation

This research branch is a CLEAN REBUILD, NOT a playable simulation.
The old blood/ and CPU SPH/film implementation are deliberately absent.
Physically motivated small-drop algorithms and GPU reconstruction follow
the plan in fluid/research.md. Keep all physics values in SI units.
